<title>USA: ConAgra's Healthy Choice adds new sauces.</title>
<headline>ConAgra's Healthy Choice adds new sauces.</headline>
<dateline>FULLERTON, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Choice, a unit of ConAgra Inc, said on Friday it was launching Garlic Lovers pasta sauces nationally this month.</p>
<p>Introduction of the four sauces will be supported with a $5 million television advertising campaign beginning in mid-September and with coupon inserts in Sunday newspapers throughout the year.</p>
<p>The new offerings extend the line of Healthy Choice pasta sauces to 12 flavors.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
